{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Build, Manage, and Grow Your Own Grocery Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your store from the ground up in first-person or manage operations from above with a free camera. Stock shelves, operate the register, hire employees, and expand your business into a thriving retail operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump behind the counter with the handheld scanner to clear long lines yourself, or rely on your staff to keep customers moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order inventory directly from your office tablet, manage supply and demand, and keep shelves stocked to maintain strong reviews and steady profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870330/extras/5dc584df80291dc6a09a4db460d84528.webp?t=1772999921\" width=252 height=45 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry individual cases or use carts to move large quantities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize warehouse freezers, coolers, and dry storage efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain shelves and optimize store layout</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870330/extras/dddf95565a07971b263b3bebe8b73e28.poster.avif?t=1772999921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870330/extras/dddf95565a07971b263b3bebe8b73e28.webm?t=1772999921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870330/extras/dddf95565a07971b263b3bebe8b73e28.mp4?t=1772999921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph